<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύ̆λ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mill</i>: in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i>hand-mill</i> turned by women, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μὲν ἀλετρεύουσι μύλης ἔπι μήλοπα
					καρπόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.104
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ . . ἀλετρὶς πλησίον, ἔνθ᾽ ἄρα
					οἱ μύλαι ἥατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.106
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλην στρέφειν, περιάγειν,
				περιφέρειν, περιελαύνειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.180
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲ μύλαν</span> (
				Dor.
			) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεῖμεν μηδὲ ὅλμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1126.24
				</span></i>
			 (Amphict. Delph., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>): Cret.acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλανς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					180.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>nether millstone</i> (the upper being <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				648
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μύλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					383b7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>knee-pan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				450
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				494a5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.35.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>hard formation</i> in a woman's womb, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				775b25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> pl.,
				<i>molars</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				29.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.Lond.
				24.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				9.15
			</span></i>: sg., of an ass's <i>tooth, PMag. Lond.</i><i><span class="en">
				125.22
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶλυ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.80
			</span></i>: root of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάπαθον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				1.251
			</span></i>. (Cf. Lat. <i>molo</i>, Goth. <i>malan</i> 'grind',
			etc.)</div>
